 Decisions: two promoted from a thread on a Widget of a Variant, one asked of the whole View.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the Workbench chrome follows the Workbench language, so its text is baked here per Locale. The Decisions and View names are sample content."],"intent":"Show the Decisions tab of the Overview as built from Adapter Widgets only: every pending Decision of every View in one list, each with the question, the View it belongs to and, when the thread it came from named them, the Variant and the Widget, so a reviewer can see what is waiting for an answer without opening each View.","interactionRules":["A row opens its View on the Spec tab, and selects the Variant and the Widget it names; a Decision that was asked of the whole View opens the View alone.","Only pending Decisions are listed: a deferred or decided Decision stays in the Spec of its View, and the empty list says so.","The count beside the title reads \"No pending Decisions\", \"1 pending Decision\" or \"n pending Decisions\", and \"Loading Decisions\" while the list is read; a list that cannot be read says so, with Try again, and shows no stale rows."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","viewId":"2e2f88d6-7a95-424a-b3d4-4661d811ef13"},{"relation":"opens","type":"view","viewId":"b1c7e304-4a1d-4c2e-9f31-7a4c0d2e6b04"}],"requirements":["01a11544-5f18-77ac-b89e-56ced4056f19"]},"variants":{"empty":{"requirements":["01a11544-5f18-77ac-b89e-56ced4056f19"],"state":{"dec-count-0":{"visible":true},"dec-count-3":{"visible":false},"dec-empty":{"visible":true},"dec-list":{"visible":false}}},"load-failed":{"state":{"dec-count-0":{"visible":true},"dec-count-3":{"visible":false},"dec-failed":{"visible":true},"dec-list":{"visible":false}